---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
---
<Layout>
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-[var(--color-canvas-white)] text-[var(--color-obsidian)]">
    <section class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-[1280px] flex-col gap-[23px] px-6 pb-10 pt-8 md:px-10">
      <header class="flex items-center justify-between">
        <p class="rounded-[var(--radius-pill)] border border-[var(--color-obsidian)] px-4 py-2 text-[20px] font-bold tracking-[-0.01em]">
          Nodouno
        </p>
        <nav class="flex items-center gap-3 text-[17px]">
          <a href="/dashboard" class="rounded-[var(--radius-pill)] px-4 py-2 hover:bg-[var(--color-obsidian)] hover:text-[var(--color-canvas-white)]">
            Dashboard
          </a>
          <a href="/editor" class="rounded-[var(--radius-pill)] px-4 py-2 hover:bg-[var(--color-obsidian)] hover:text-[var(--color-canvas-white)]">
            Editor
          </a>
        </nav>
      </header>

      <div class="section-gap grid gap-[23px] lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr] lg:items-end">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-[23px]">
          <p class="text-[20px] text-[var(--color-slate-mist)]">Calculo estructural simplificado</p>
          <h1 class="max-w-[12ch] text-[52px] font-bold leading-[0.85] tracking-[-0.02em] md:text-[131px]">
            MENOS CLICK. MAS ESTRUCTURA.
          </h1>
          <p class="max-w-[60ch] text-[17px] text-[var(--color-slate-mist)]">
            Modela losa, vigas y columnas con un flujo directo: dibujar, calcular, dimensionar y exportar.
            Diseno monocromatico, interfaz limpia y foco total en resultados.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
            <Button href="/editor" variant="primary">Comenzar ahora</Button>
            <Button href="/dashboard" variant="dark">Ver proyectos</Button>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-3 grid gap-[11px] sm:grid-cols-3">
            <div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-[var(--color-obsidian)] p-[22px]">
              <p class="text-[52px] font-bold leading-[0.9]">4</p>
              <p class="text-[17px] text-[var(--color-slate-mist)]">pasos de flujo</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-[var(--color-obsidian)] p-[22px]">
              <p class="text-[52px] font-bold leading-[0.9]">1</p>
              <p class="text-[17px] text-[var(--color-slate-mist)]">modelo base</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-[var(--color-obsidian)] p-[22px]">
              <p class="text-[52px] font-bold leading-[0.9]">0</p>
              <p class="text-[17px] text-[var(--color-slate-mist)]">ruido visual</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-panel rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-[var(--color-obsidian)] p-[22px] text-[var(--color-canvas-white)]">
          <p class="text-[17px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-[var(--color-slate-mist)]">Flujo nodouno</p>
          <div class="mt-[23px] flex flex-col gap-[23px]">
            <article class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.2)] p-[22px]">
              <p class="text-[30px] font-bold leading-[1.1]">01. Draft</p>
              <p class="mt-2 text-[17px] text-[var(--color-slate-mist)]">Define geometria base y cargas iniciales.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.2)] p-[22px]">
              <p class="text-[30px] font-bold leading-[1.1]">02. Calculated</p>
              <p class="mt-2 text-[17px] text-[var(--color-slate-mist)]">Obtiene solicitaciones y verificaciones de forma inmediata.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.2)] p-[22px]">
              <p class="text-[30px] font-bold leading-[1.1]">03. Dimensioned</p>
              <p class="mt-2 text-[17px] text-[var(--color-slate-mist)]">Genera armado y computo metrico para documentar.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="border-y border-[var(--color-obsidian)] bg-[var(--color-canvas-white)] py-4">
      <div class="marquee">
        <span>Nodouno - Draft - Drawn - Calculated - Dimensioned - Supabase - Vercel - Nodouno - Draft - Drawn - Calculated - Dimensioned</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-[var(--color-obsidian)] text-[var(--color-canvas-white)]">
      <div class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-[1280px] gap-[23px] px-6 py-16 md:grid-cols-3 md:px-10">
        <article class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.2)] p-[22px]">
          <h2 class="text-[30px] font-bold leading-[1.1]">Simple por fuera</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-[17px] text-[var(--color-slate-mist)]">Interfaz enfocada en decisiones rapidas y sin ruido visual.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.2)] p-[22px]">
          <h2 class="text-[30px] font-bold leading-[1.1]">Rigido por dentro</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-[17px] text-[var(--color-slate-mist)]">Persistencia con Supabase, RLS activa y flujos listos para escalar.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.2)] p-[22px]">
          <h2 class="text-[30px] font-bold leading-[1.1]">Listo para iterar</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-[17px] text-[var(--color-slate-mist)]">Rama develop con preview para validar cada cambio antes de salir.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-[1280px] flex-col gap-[23px] px-6 py-16 md:px-10">
      <div class="grid gap-[23px] lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_1fr]">
        <article class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-[var(--color-obsidian)] bg-[var(--color-canvas-white)] p-[22px]">
          <p class="text-[20px] text-[var(--color-slate-mist)]">Vision</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 max-w-[18ch] text-[63px] font-bold leading-[0.91] tracking-[-0.02em]">Calcular como un estudio serio, sin interfaz pesada.</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 max-w-[60ch] text-[17px] text-[var(--color-slate-mist)]">
            Nodouno combina la estetica de producto premium con reglas tecnicas reales para que tu equipo pase menos tiempo en setup y mas tiempo en ingenieria.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-[var(--color-obsidian)] bg-[var(--color-obsidian)] p-[22px] text-[var(--color-canvas-white)]">
          <p class="text-[20px] text-[var(--color-slate-mist)]">Siguiente paso</p>
          <h3 class="mt-3 text-[52px] font-bold leading-[1] tracking-[-0.02em]">Entrar al editor</h3>
          <p class="mt-4 text-[17px] text-[var(--color-slate-mist)]">
            Crea tu primer proyecto y recorre el flujo completo de draft a dimensionado.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-6">
            <Button href="/editor" variant="primary">Abrir editor</Button>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
